<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Contal sets payouts.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Contal sets payouts.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bottler Grupo Contal said on Friday it will pay a 0.14 peso cash dividend per share in circulation.</p>
<p>The company said through the Mexican stock market that the dividend was approved in its annual shareholders meeting on Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
